Z||000000||Phil||01-06-2001||05:12 PM||||Just dragged my 5th Fiero home today. I think that if you have more than one they breed. It was going to be a parts car(I have 3 88's and this is another one)but after putting a batt. in it the silly thing fired right up and sounds good. Might do some parts swapping. The wife wanted a t-top so we found an 88 coupe 5sp but she kinda wants an auto, sooooo along comes this 88 coupe auto ($300) with 4 brand new tires but something is wrong with the brakes and some trouble with the control arms (don't know what yet hopefully the control arms are just bushings). To top it all off the guy says to me as I'm leaving "I've got this black bag that says Fiero on it, do you want that too"?(no charge) Brandy new sun shade. Now to the problem -Do I keep it as a parts car or repair it and sell it. Ahhh the problems of life.||||reg||1
